              "audioEnd": 21.75
            },
            {
              "text": "Because he was strong and quick, Rikki-Tikki decided to defend his new home from them.",
              "audioStart": 22.613,
              "audioEnd": 26.938
            },
            {
              "text": "Through work and smart action, he managed to trick both enemies during several dangerous encounters.",
              "audioStart": 27.8,
              "audioEnd": 33.062
            },
            {
              "text": "He fought hard against them so that the family would remain safe from harm.",
              "audioStart": 33.925,
              "audioEnd": 37.462
            },
            {
              "text": "After defeating the big animals, he searched everywhere until he found the last hidden egg.",
              "audioStart": 38.325,
              "audioEnd": 42.95
            },
            {
              "text": "Destroying that final egg ended their terrible control over the garden once and for all.",
              "audioStart": 43.812,
              "audioEnd": 48.288
            },
            {
              "text": "Peace returned to the lovely place where the family lived happily every day.",
              "audioStart": 49.15,
              "audioEnd": 52.812
            },
            {
              "text": "The garden was quiet again, and all the small creatures felt safe once more.",
              "audioStart": 53.675,
              "audioEnd": 57.763
            },
            {
              "text": "If he had not arrived, the danger would have continued.",
              "audioStart": 58.625,
              "audioEnd": 61.312
            },
            {
              "text": "Every single person was very grateful for his courage.",
              "audioStart": 62.175,
              "audioEnd": 65.125
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Proud Rikki-Tikki kept a careful watch over the house day and night.",
              "audioStart": 65.987,
              "audioEnd": 69.375
            },
            {
              "text": "He always stayed near the people he had come to love so deeply.",
              "audioStart": 70.237,
              "audioEnd": 73.338
            },
            {
              "text": "His strong heart and quick mind ensured that everyone lived safely in their quiet home.",
              "audioStart": 74.2,
              "audioEnd": 78.513
            },
            {
              "text": "He walked around the garden every morning to check if anything was wrong.",
              "audioStart": 79.375,
              "audioEnd": 82.85
            },
            {
              "text": "The family felt very happy because they knew that Rikki-Tikki was watching them.",
              "audioStart": 83.713,
              "audioEnd": 87.537
            },
            {
              "text": "He slept near the door during the night, keeping watch against any possible danger.",
              "audioStart": 88.4,
              "audioEnd": 92.7
            },
            {
              "text": "Many small creatures came to him to say thank you for his hard work.",
              "audioStart": 93.562,
              "audioEnd": 96.963
            },
            {
              "text": "They told him stories about how much the area had changed since he arrived.",
