              "audioEnd": 101.6
            },
            {
              "text": "Before he came, nobody could walk outside without fear.",
              "audioStart": 102.463,
              "audioEnd": 105.6
            },
            {
              "text": "Now, children played on the grass and birds sang in the trees.",
              "audioStart": 106.463,
              "audioEnd": 109.725
            },
            {
              "text": "Rikki-Tikki smiled and told them that keeping everyone safe was his primary goal.",
              "audioStart": 110.588,
              "audioEnd": 114.862
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone brightly upon the lovely flowers and green plants.",
              "audioStart": 115.725,
              "audioEnd": 119.15
            },
            {
              "text": "Life went on smoothly day after day.",
              "audioStart": 120.013,
              "audioEnd": 122.037
            },
            {
              "text": "He spent his hours resting in the warm sun.",
              "audioStart": 122.9,
              "audioEnd": 125.237
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Days passed into weeks, and the calm environment remained completely the same.",
              "audioStart": 126.1,
              "audioEnd": 130.225
            },
            {
              "text": "The family spent many hours sitting together in the garden while reading books.",
              "audioStart": 131.088,
              "audioEnd": 134.85
            },
            {
              "text": "Rikki-Tikki lay nearby, enjoying the warm light on his soft body.",
              "audioStart": 135.713,
              "audioEnd": 139.512
            },
            {
              "text": "Whenever a strange sound occurred, he stood up quickly to investigate.",
              "audioStart": 140.375,
              "audioEnd": 143.975
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could surprise him because his attention never stopped.",
              "audioStart": 144.838,
              "audioEnd": 147.838
            },
            {
              "text": "The kind family provided him with good food and a special place to sleep.",
              "audioStart": 148.7,
              "audioEnd": 152.55
            },
            {
              "text": "He appreciated their love and gave them his absolute trust in return.",
              "audioStart": 153.412,
              "audioEnd": 157.012
            },
            {
              "text": "This wonderful relationship brought joy to everyone living in the house.",
              "audioStart": 157.875,
              "audioEnd": 161.512
            },
            {
              "text": "The garden remained a safe place for all creatures who lived there.",
              "audioStart": 162.375,
              "audioEnd": 165.575
            },
            {
              "text": "Rikki-Tikki became a true hero whose name would be remembered forever.",
              "audioStart": 166.438,
              "audioEnd": 169.912
            },
            {
              "text": "His story spread across the country, showing how one small animal could change everything.",
              "audioStart": 170.775,
              "audioEnd": 175.412
            },
            {
              "text": "People talked about his great work whenever they visited the area.",
              "audioStart": 176.275,
              "audioEnd": 179.412
            },
            {
              "text": "He was known as the best defender in the world.",
              "audioStart": 180.275,
              "audioEnd": 182.488
            },
            {
              "text": "No one could ever forget his brave actions.",
              "audioStart": 183.35,
              "audioEnd": 185.7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Even though the battles were difficult, Rikki-Tikki never lost hope.",
              "audioStart": 186.562,
              "audioEnd": 189.975
            },
            {
              "text": "He always believed that good would win over evil in the end.",
              "audioStart": 190.838,
              "audioEnd": 193.725
            },
            {
              "text": "His friends supported him through every single challenge he faced.",
              "audioStart": 194.588,
              "audioEnd": 197.787
            },
            {
              "text": "Together, they built a society based on trust and mutual respect.",
              "audioStart": 198.65,
              "audioEnd": 202.525
            },
            {
              "text": "The memory of those dangerous days faded slowly into the background.",
              "audioStart": 203.387,
              "audioEnd": 206.725
            },
            {
              "text": "New flowers grew where the old problems once existed.",
              "audioStart": 207.588,
              "audioEnd": 210.35
            },
            {
              "text": "The air felt fresh and clean every morning.",
              "audioStart": 211.213,
              "audioEnd": 213.512
            },
            {
              "text": "Rikki-Tikki looked around his home with a sense of deep satisfaction.",
              "audioStart": 214.375,
              "audioEnd": 217.887
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that his job was done properly and well.",
              "audioStart": 218.75,
              "audioEnd": 221.125
            },
            {
              "text": "The house stood tall against the background of the beautiful blue sky.",
              "audioStart": 221.988,
              "audioEnd": 225.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Every member of the family smiled when they looked at their little defender.",
              "audioStart": 225.988,
              "audioEnd": 229.338
            },
            {
              "text": "Life went on smoothly, bringing happiness to all who shared this special place.",
              "audioStart": 230.2,
              "audioEnd": 234.363
            },
            {
              "text": "If anyone needed help, he was always ready.",
              "audioStart": 235.225,
              "audioEnd": 237.725
